    "detailed_description": "Dr. Agnes Shelley wants to steal your eggs, but you're not about to let that happen. Single Feather is a platformer that combines nostalgic pixel art with the beauty of nature.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964930/extras/bc92537437ca514534c966469f7c6bf4.poster.avif?t=1739410317\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964930/extras/bc92537437ca514534c966469f7c6bf4.webm?t=1739410317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964930/extras/bc92537437ca514534c966469f7c6bf4.mp4?t=1739410317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>This game comes with a feature-rich level editor that is easy to learn, but here's the catch: Any level you create belongs to YOU and can be shared and played by anyone in the world, regardless of whether or not they themselves own a copy of Single Feather.<br><br>Express your creativity with the level editor. Share your levels with friends or a community of other players. Unlock features by progressing through the campaign of levels.",
    "about_the_game": "Dr. Agnes Shelley wants to steal your eggs, but you're not about to let that happen. Single Feather is a platformer that combines nostalgic pixel art with the beauty of nature.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964930/extras/bc92537437ca514534c966469f7c6bf4.poster.avif?t=1739410317\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964930/extras/bc92537437ca514534c966469f7c6bf4.webm?t=1739410317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964930/extras/bc92537437ca514534c966469f7c6bf4.mp4?t=1739410317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>This game comes with a feature-rich level editor that is easy to learn, but here's the catch: Any level you create belongs to YOU and can be shared and played by anyone in the world, regardless of whether or not they themselves own a copy of Single Feather.<br><br>Express your creativity with the level editor. Share your levels with friends or a community of other players. Unlock features by progressing through the campaign of levels.",
